+            <li>The MDPI design uses coherent, phase-controlled inputs in FDTD. Its simulated thresholds and contrast are specific to its architecture and assumptions. <a href="https://doi.org/10.3390/nano15100707">Nanomaterials, 2025</a>.</li>
